{"id":"word:hebrew:H1834","type":"word","title":"דַּמֶּשֶׂק","subtitle":"H1834 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"Damascus , a city of Syria","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to דַּמֶּשֶׂק (H1834) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-pr-loc.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 45 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"דַּמֶּשֶׂק (Dammeseq) means Damascus , a city of Syria First listed occurrence: 1Chr 18 5."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"דַּמֶּשֶׂק","transliteration":"Dammeseq","pronunciation":"dam-meh'-sek","strong":"H1834","lemmaId":"hebrew:H1834","partOfSpeech":"n-pr-loc","forms":["דַּמֶּ֔שֶׂק","דַּרְמֶ֔שֶׂק","דַמֶּ֨שֶׂק֙","דַּמֶּ֗שֶׂק","דַּמֶּ֧שֶׂק"],"morphs":[["HNp",31],["HR/Np",13],["HC/Np",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"Damascus , a city of Syria","usage":"Damascus.","full":"H1834. Dammeseq דַּמֶּ֫שֶׂק proper name, of a location Damascus (Assyrian Dimaš‡i, Dimas‡i , Dl Pa 280 Schr COT Gen 15:2 & ABK 323 Jäger BAS ii. 281 f. Arabic , ; Aramaic ᵑ7 Onk , etc. דמשק , Ps-Jon דרמשק ; ) — דַּמֶּשֶׂק 1Kin 11:24 28 t.; דַּמָּ֑שֶׂק Gen 14:15 8 t.; דַּרְמֶשֶׂק 1Chr 18:5 3 t. ch; דַּרְמָ֑שֶׂק 2Chr 24:23 ; 28:5 ; דּוּמֶּשֶׂק 2Kin 16:10 ; דְּמֶשֶׁק Amos 3:12 see following, Vrss. דַּמֶּשֶׂק ; — ancient Aramaean city, situated latitude 33 degrees 30 minutes north, longitude 36 degrees 15 minutes east, in plain east of Hermon & southeast of Anti-Lebanon; on the Nahr Baradâ (Greek Chrysorrhoas); modern Dimish‡ & Esh-Sham, Rob BR iii. 440 ff. Bd Pal 307 ; Damascus Gen 14:15 ; Amos 5:27 ; 1Kin 11:24 (twice in verse); 2Kin 14:28 ; Song 7:5 ; so also probably Gen 15:2 (perhaps gloss compare Di), ( Amos 3:12 see following); a trading-centre Ezek 27:18 ; as capital & residence of king of Aram 1Kin 15:18 2Chr 16:2 , compare 1Kin 20:34 ; 2Kin 16:9-10 , (twice in verse); 16:11 (twice in verse); 16:12 ; 2Chr 28:5 ; Isa 7:8 (twice in verse); 8:4 ; 10:9 (compare Peters Hebraica. April 1885, 242 ) 17:1 (twice in verse); 17:3 ; Jer 49:23-24 , 27 ; including also surrounding territory Ezek 47:16-17 , compare 47:18 ; 48:1 , see ד ׳מִדְבַּ֫רָה 1Kin 19:15 ; ד ׳נַהֲרוֺת 2Kin 5:12 ; = kingdom Amos 1:3 , 5 compare Zech 9:1 ; once (late) ד ׳מֶלֶךְ 2Chr 24:23 ; note also ד ׳אֲרַם 2Sam 8:5-6 , = 1Chr 18:5-6 , further ד ׳אֱלֹהֵי 2Chr 28:23 (|| אֲרָם מַלְכֵי אֱלֹהֵי ).","rootNote":"or דּוּמֶשֶׂק ; or דַּרְמֶשֶׂק ; of foreign origin;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 18 5","keyReferences":["1Chr 18 5","1Chr 18 6","1Kgs 11 24","1Kgs 11 24","1Kgs 15 18","1Kgs 19 15","1Kgs 20 34","2Chr 16 2"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":45,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 18 5","book":"1Chr","chapter":18,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דַּרְמֶ֔שֶׂק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 18 6","book":"1Chr","chapter":18,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דַּרְמֶ֔שֶׂק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 11 24","book":"1Kgs","chapter":11,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דַמֶּ֨שֶׂק֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 11 24","book":"1Kgs","chapter":11,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/דַמָּֽשֶׂק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"1Kgs 15 18","book":"1Kgs","chapter":15,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/דַמֶּ֖שֶׂק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"1Kgs 19 15","book":"1Kgs","chapter":19,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דַמָּ֑שֶׂק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 20 34","book":"1Kgs","chapter":20,"verse":34,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְ/דַמֶּ֨שֶׂק֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"2Chr 16 2","book":"2Chr","chapter":16,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/דַרְמֶ֖שֶׂק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"2Chr 24 23","book":"2Chr","chapter":24,"verse":23,"englishText":"","s